  Title:
    m_Untranslated: 1. Workspace
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: Open Expedition > Mod SDK > Mod Workspace. This window lets you select, validate, build and install a mod. Choose DataAndPresentation for your first walkthrough. The tutorial uses the current scene without replacing it.
